{"id":"00020","root":"uni00020_1","name":{"ja":"リリス・アーベル・ビンダーナーゲル","en":"Lilith Abel Bindernagel"},"title":null,"displayName":{"ja":"リリス・アーベル・ビンダーナーゲル","en":"Lilith Abel Bindernagel"},"element":"Devilish","rarity":5,"rarityLabel":"UR","roles":[],"traits":["Magic"],"release":"2018-09-25","limited":false,"characterId":20,"profile":{"ja":"通称“黒蛇の魔女”。神に反逆し神々を異界に追いやったとされる伝説の大魔女リリスの孫娘。高位魔族の少女でその寿命は数万年に及ぶという。魔界の住人なら誰もが知り恐れ、３００キロは避けて通ると謳われた祖母の名を継いで二代目リリスとなり、武者修行のために人界に降り立つ。才能は魔界随一だがいまだ未熟者。１人ではオークの群れにも逃げ惑うレベルだが秘めたる野望は誰にも負けない天然系。男なら誰しも気になる巨乳の美少女。先代から仕える使い魔（＝従者）、メスの白い犬ベリリクが彼女を護衛し普段の生活をサポートしている。リリスはちょっと長生きで人に化けれるただの白い犬と信じて疑っていないが、ベリリクの正体は神殺しで知られる古代龍（エンシェント・ドラゴン）である。","en":"(Lilith Abel Bindernagel, she/her) Lilith Abel Bindernagel, known as the \"Black Serpent Witch,\" is the granddaughter of the legendary great witch Lilith the First, who rebelled against the gods and banished them to another world. As a high-rank demon girl, her lifespan stretches for tens of thousands of years. Feared by all Demon Realm inhabitants, she inherited her grandmother's name and became the second Lilith, descending to the Human Realm for warrior training. Though her talent ranks among the best in the Demon Realm, she remains inexperienced; alone, she can barely fend off a horde of orcs, yet her hidden ambition is unmatched. She is a busty beauty who catches every man's eye. Serving her is a familiar—a white female dog named Beririku—who protects her and assists with daily life. Lilith believes, without doubt, that Beririku is merely a long-lived white dog capable of shapeshifting, unaware that the familiar is actually an ancient dragon famed for slaying gods."},"illustrator":"旭","voiceActor":"中家志穂","forms":[{"id":"uni00020_1","rarity":3,"rarityLabel":"HR","levelMax":60,"stats":{"hp":[988,1976],"sp":[150,150],"atk":[149,298],"def":[128,256],"spd":[61,61],"luck":[1,90]},"spCharge":36,"skills":["2","59"]},{"id":"uni00020_2","rarity":4,"rarityLabel":"SR","levelMax":80,"stats":{"hp":[1476,2952],"sp":[25